### Runtime behavior

- **Live crawl** (`lib/crawl.js`): runs via `runDeterministicRules({ page, ... })`.
- **Metrics-only analyze**: pass `metrics.buttonGroupMaxReport` or the check no-ops (same pattern as `DET.AMBIENT.Z_INDEX`).
